+- **Situation**: after delivery to `main` (`ded0223`) and the mission review (`b18a000`), `method agent mission accept --mission troupe-config-include-overrides-01M46FY4` blocked for two reasons: it refuses to run on `main` (it must run on the mission or target branch), and the repository has no `docs/` directory (the software-dev path convention).
